# Dissection Tools (5): its enters trigger manifests dread (CR 701.62a) - of Llanowar Elves and Lightning Bolt the Elves
# goes face down as a 2/2 and the Bolt to the graveyard - then attaches the Equipment to that creature (CR 701.3a), so the
# face-down permanent is a 4/4 with deathtouch and lifelink. Equip is "Sacrifice a creature" with no mana, at sorcery
# speed: Bot1 sacrifices the face-down creature and the Tools moves to Ornithopter (0/2 -> 2/4).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Dissection Tools
Ornithopter
Plains x2
Llanowar Elves
Lightning Bolt
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
! Bot1.Hand.Dissection Tools.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Dissection Tools.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Llanowar Elves | Lightning Bolt)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus
? Bot1.Battlefield..FaceDown = true
? Bot1.Battlefield..FaceDownName = Llanowar Elves
? Bot1.Battlefield..Power = 4
? Bot1.Battlefield..Toughness = 4
? Bot1.Battlefield..Keywords = Deathtouch; Lifelink
Bot1.Battlefield.Dissection Tools.Activate(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Choose(#1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves; Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dissection Tools.AttachedTo = Ornithopter
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 4
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Deathtouch; Flying; Lifelink

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves; Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus
Bot1.Battlefield.Dissection Tools.AttachedTo = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Deathtouch; Flying; Lifelink
